{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#card-zh","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-net（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让 DeepSeek Harness 在运行时接入系统代理并信任操作系统证书库，帮助系统代理模式下的网络加速器或企业代理环境正常完成请求。它会优先沿用已有代理设置，也可检测 Windows 系统代理、探测常见本地端口或使用手动地址；同时合并系统与额外 PEM 证书，并可为后续 Node 子进程传递证书信任。适合遇到代理路由或 TLS 证书连接问题的 DSH 用户。需要支持的 Node 版本；默认向 GitHub API 发起一次连接自检。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:483-528","index.js:575-643","index.js:780-805"]}
{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#card-en","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-system-net makes DSH use an existing or detected proxy and trust system certificates. It supports manual proxy URLs, local port probing, extra PEM certificates, retry, and status reporting. Needs a supported Node version; a GitHub API check runs by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:483-528","index.js:575-643","index.js:780-805"]}
