{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#feature-proxy","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-net 的功能「代理设置自动识别」：加载时按配置沿用环境代理、读取 Windows 系统代理或探测常见本地端口，也支持手动代理地址；识别后通过 DSH 官方代理入口安装路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:483-528","index.js:575-643"]}
{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#feature-cert","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-net 的功能「系统证书信任」：启用后合并 Node 默认根证书、操作系统证书库和配置的 PEM 文件，并更新当前进程的 TLS 默认信任集合。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:115-190"]}
{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#feature-retry","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-net 的功能「代理延迟重试」：自动模式首次未找到代理时按配置间隔重试，代理安装成功后停止计时器，适合先启动 DSH 再打开代理软件的情况。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:760-778"]}
{"unit_id":"chickmat__dsh-system-net#feature-status","repo":"chickmat/dsh-system-net","commit":"1b31302ab5339dac3ee7f0d74c214fa1b0b73b0f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-system-net 的功能「连接状态与自检」：启动时可对配置的 URL 发起一次请求，并把代理来源、证书状态、自检结果等写入状态 JSON，便于查看当前是否完成装配。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:656-681","index.js:690-723","index.js:796-805"]}
